  "detailed_description": "The “Integrated Agriculture Training Centre (IATC) Scheme” was launched by the Department of Agriculture &amp;amp; Farmers’ Welfare, Government of Meghalaya to provide training for enhancing the skills of farmers besides imparting updated agricultural technologies to departmental functionaries. Awareness Programmes/ trainings conducted periodically.\n",
  "eligibility": "\n- The applicant should be a permanent resident of Meghalaya.\n- The applicant should be a bonafide farmer engaged in agriculture.\n\n",
  "exclusions": null,
